# CLAUDE.local.md — Personal Overrides
#
# This file is GITIGNORED. It contains machine-local or personal preferences
# that should not be shared with the team.
#
# To activate: copy to CLAUDE.local.md in the project root.
# cp CLAUDE.local.md.example CLAUDE.local.md
#
# Instructions here override project-level CLAUDE.md on conflict.
# Keep this file minimal — only personal deviations from team defaults belong here.

---

## Personal Tooling Preferences

# Example: if you prefer a different terminal pager
# env: PAGER=less

## Local Infrastructure

# If your local postgres runs on a non-standard port
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://REDACTED_DB_CRED@localhost:5433/devdb

## Editor Integration

# If you use a specific Python interpreter path not managed by uv
# PYTHON_INTERPRETER=/usr/local/bin/python3.11

## Verbosity Preferences

# Uncomment to get verbose pytest output locally (CI always uses -q)
# pytest_default_flags = -v --tb=short

## Personal Notes for Claude

# Add any personal instructions here that you want Claude to follow
# only in your local sessions. For example:
#
# - When I say "check the DB", query the local postgres instance, not staging.
# - My preferred diff format is side-by-side (git diff --word-diff).
# - When suggesting refactors, always show before/after comparisons.
